      "statement": "LangChain streaming operates in three protocol versions: V1 callback-based (on_llm_new_token, on_llm_end), V2 event-based Runnable iteration (on_chat_model_start/stream/end), and V3 protocol events with typed projections (message-start/content-block-*/message-finish).",
